# The canonical branded icons live at the repository root, where build.sh,
# scripts/build-deb.sh, the PyInstaller spec and the Windows release workflow
# all read them. setup.py's build_py hook copies them into the cove package so
# the wheel carries the package data pyproject declares - but that hook can
# only copy what the tree it builds from actually contains, and an sdist
# includes no root-level data files by default. Without these lines a wheel
# built from an sdist ships no icons at all.
include cove_dm_icon.png
include cove_icon.png
